


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou3_04_56a4eb11:



    voice "RIN_0798"
    rin "「呼……」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou3_04_63819f54:


    "寒冷的季节里，伦靠在床栏边呼出了白色的水气。"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou3_04_5ef5a234:


    "关上了床头灯钻进被子后，却又辗转反侧。"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou3_04_92b3d59e:


    "最后还是从被子里钻出来，然后上了屋顶。"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou3_04_b16af81c:



    voice "RIN_0799"
    rin "「……触感，还留着啊」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou3_04_1cf7c0f4:


    "伦摸了摸嘴唇。"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou3_04_7c56c044:


    "看来伦睡不着觉的原因是白天时文的惊人之举。"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou3_04_80d0c1c6:



    voice "RIN_0800"
    rin "「浅生她，到底是怎么想的呢……阿嚏」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou3_04_a08ff7d3:



    voice "RIN_0801"
    rin "「虽然出来是想冷静一下脑袋，不过这也太冷了——」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou3_04_3bd9a88f:



    voice "RIN_0802"
    rin "「啊，糟了……」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou3_04_b1f25288:


    "伦警戒起来。然而门后面出现的是……"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou3_04_de07f619:



    voice "FUM_0713"
    fumi "「绪方同学，果然在这里啊」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou3_04_f4fb0905:



    voice "RIN_0803"
    rin "「浅生？为什么？」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou3_04_e6c1a8c8:



    voice "FUM_0714"
    fumi "「我察觉到你从房间出去了，就跟上来看看」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou3_04_e4221353:


    "文恶作剧地笑了笑，把背靠在伦旁边的围栏上。"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou3_04_39931c21:



    voice "FUM_0715"
    fumi "「请喝这个吧。就当代替暖宝宝了」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou3_04_7a588c38:


    "文递出了罐装咖啡。"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou3_04_7e211b6e:



    voice "RIN_0804"
    rin "「谢谢……好温暖」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou3_04_964244d0:


    "即使是没什么营养的对话，伦显得还是很僵硬。"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou3_04_5ec08fba:


    "偷偷地瞅着文的侧脸，伦刚到嘴边的话又咽了下去。"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou3_04_27ee6ff0:


    "伦所在意的事情，真正想问文的事情，明明就只有一件。"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou3_04_e2eba5ef:



    voice "RIN_0805"
    rin "「………………」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou3_04_923a448a:



    voice "FUM_0716"
    fumi "「…………」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou3_04_06983587:


    "闲聊突然中断。"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou3_04_a6a9bfc5:



    voice "RIN_0806"
    rin "「说起来白天的那件事……」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou3_04_a20b4acd:



    voice "FUM_0717"
    fumi "「白天的那件事是指？」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou3_04_60b76335:



    voice "RIN_0807"
    rin "「那个，就是，那件……」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou3_04_6fe0e1c4:



    voice "FUM_0718"
    fumi "「kiss的事情，是吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou3_04_99701db6:



    voice "RIN_0808"
    rin "「诶，啊……嗯，是的」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou3_04_0c47dca8:


    "伦把罐装咖啡一口气喝完了。"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou3_04_d569e4a5:



    voice "RIN_0809"
    rin "「说实话，从那以后太在意那件事了，所以才睡不着觉来了屋顶」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou3_04_69552aa7:



    voice "FUM_0719"
    fumi "「是这样啊」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou3_04_c938a9ec:



    voice "RIN_0810"
    rin "「……浅生好像不怎么在意呢」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou3_04_6e445980:



    voice "FUM_0720"
    fumi "「诶，我也是很紧张的哦？」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou3_04_874c7873:



    voice "RIN_0811"
    rin "「看不出来啊」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou3_04_00fc0236:



    voice "FUM_0721"
    fumi "「怎么这样。现在想起那件事也会心跳不已……你看」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou3_04_e3383e5a:



    voice "RIN_0812"
    rin "「啊……」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou3_04_f9e05cf8:


    "文这么说着抓起伦的手，放在了自己的胸上。"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou3_04_c48258e9:


    "伦被毫无恶意的攻势吓得缩了一下。"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou3_04_9593b88f:



    voice "RIN_0813"
    rin "「真的……啊」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou3_04_cdaf600e:


    "传入手掌的柔软触感和炙热跳动，让伦咽了一下口水。"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou3_04_3a0ffcfe:



    voice "FUM_0722"
    fumi "「对吧？」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou3_04_58a8d2e4:


    "文低下了头，看不见她的表情。"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou3_04_99d5e8a0:



    voice "RIN_0814"
    rin "「……浅生」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou3_04_1f6252ef:



    voice "FUM_0723"
    fumi "「是……」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou3_04_2ecc3977:


    "伦认真的声音让文抬起头。可以看出她的表情有些许胆怯。"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou3_04_7b092f98:



    voice "RIN_0815"
    rin "「这回让我来，行吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou3_04_9ea21ca2:



    voice "FUM_0724"
    fumi "「…………」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou3_04_5fb162d1:


    "文点点头。"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou3_04_29266b5d:


    "伦用手指抬起她纤细的下颌时，文闭上了眼睛。"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou3_04_0839ed7d:



    voice "RIN_0816"
    rin "「嗯……」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou3_04_50d8ab66:



    voice "FUM_0725"
    fumi "「呼啊……」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou3_04_f00d6c98:


    "两人的嘴唇再次重叠。"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou3_04_29a1c0b2:



    voice "RIN_0817"
    rin "「……嗯嗯」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou3_04_e9795c1a:


    "伦的舌头企图撬开文的嘴唇。"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou3_04_72255b54:



    voice "FUM_0726"
    fumi "「啊……嗯……呼」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou3_04_f5ef7804:


    "虽然一开始对方显得不知所措，但是立马听话地遵从了要求。"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou3_04_0e4ceab3:



    voice "RIN_0818"
    rin "「咕……嗯……啾……呼啊」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou3_04_22506fae:



    voice "FUM_0727"
    fumi "「嗯……嗯啾……嗯呼」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou3_04_caf4c589:


    "交缠的舌头渐渐染上热度。"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou3_04_a9cc6bb1:



    voice "FUM_0728"
    fumi "「……啊？」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou3_04_3be787b4:


    "文发出了小小的叫声，身体变得僵硬。"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou3_04_4ad6685f:


    "理由是伦的手再次碰到了文的胸部。"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou3_04_5e40d5c7:



    voice "RIN_0819"
    rin "「浅生……」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou3_04_38a553f2:



    voice "FUM_0729"
    fumi "「………绪方同学」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou3_04_65b099a3:


    "两人用目光交流着。"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou3_04_7711a6a8:


    "即使瞳孔湿润，文也没有拒绝。"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou3_04_779d9408:



    voice "RIN_0820"
    rin "「……………」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou3_04_dc6d5422:


    "然后，伦颤抖的手指搭上了文的睡衣纽扣。"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou3_04_5456a91c:


    "一颗，两颗……纽扣逐渐解开，文的胸口露了出来。"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou3_04_2a663c11:



    voice "FUM_0730"
    fumi "「啊，啊啊……啊……呼……阿嚏！」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou3_04_3b5599f2:



    voice "RIN_0821"
    rin "「啊……抱歉，浅生！很冷吧！？」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou3_04_aff5b37a:



    voice "FUM_0731"
    fumi "「啊……没关系……的，阿嚏」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou3_04_fe97b462:



    voice "HIN_0949"
    hina "「啊，居然在这里！」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou3_04_8f50900c:


    "从屋顶的楼梯上下来，没想到碰到了阳菜和祥子。"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou3_04_90d8aabc:



    voice "HIN_0950"
    hina "「睡醒发现你们两个都不见踪影，让我担心死了」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou3_04_6d7cfc02:



    voice "RIN_0822"
    rin "「抱歉，有点睡不着……」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou3_04_5a640ef6:



    voice "FUM_0732"
    fumi "「我也是……」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou3_04_73018439:



    voice "SYO_0131"
    sachiko "「晚上擅自跑去屋顶是不行的哦？虽然我也有错，忘了上锁就是了」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou3_04_977cde80:



    voice "FUM_0733"
    fumi "「对不起」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou3_04_8f77c565:



    voice "SYO_0132"
    sachiko "「嗯……？」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou3_04_b7bc4eda:



    voice "FUM_0734"
    fumi "「怎么了？」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou3_04_2f70126c:



    voice "SYO_0133"
    sachiko "「纽扣，扣错了哦，文文」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou3_04_74c8da71:



    voice "FUM_0735"
    fumi "「啊……还真是」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou3_04_d16c3617:


    "文慌张地重新扣好。"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou3_04_cc60e08b:



    voice "HIN_0951"
    hina "「唔啊……」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou3_04_ca481c72:



    voice "SYO_0134"
    sachiko "「好啦好啦，已经很晚了大家快回屋睡觉」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou3_04_2b564225:



    voice "HIN_0952"
    hina "「嗯，晚安」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou3_04_4865cbfe:



    voice "FUM_0736"
    fumi "「好的，晚安」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou3_04_9e933906:


    "三人朝房间走去。"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou3_04_9485d3dd:



    voice "SYO_0135"
    sachiko "「……伦？」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou3_04_aa767f7f:



    voice "RIN_0823"
    rin "「嗯？」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou3_04_cb4944e5:



    voice "SYO_0136"
    sachiko "「{size=15}加油啊{/size}」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou3_04_113a4c7a:



    voice "RIN_0824"
    rin "「呜……」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou3_04_53080e20:


    "伦马上转过头去，追上文和阳菜。"
